jobs.description:
We have a .NET Developer opportunity in Belgium that I believe could be a good match for your profile.We're looking for someone with solid experience in .NET / C# and good knowledge of authentication, particularly OAuth 2.0 or similar technologies. Some experience with Java would also be a plus.The role involves working on a project where authentication, integration, and application development are key areas.If you're open to exploring opportunities in Belgium, I'd be happy to share more details about the project, team, and conditions. 



Description du profil

Key Requirements:

• More than 10 years of professional experience in software development;
• Strong experience with .NET, C#, and backend application development;
• Proven experience with Angular and frontend development; (plus)
• Experience developing and integrating REST APIs;
• Knowledge of relational and non-relational databases;
• Understanding of software architecture, development best practices, and Agile methodologies;
• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills;
• Good command of English;
• Knowledge of French or Dutch
